<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 0.45 MLN.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 0.45 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.13 vs   0.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.56 vs   1.35</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.25 vs   1.15</p>
<p> Sales		    4.96 vs   5.15</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.45 vs   1.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.47 vs   1.87</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.75 vs   4.24</p>
<p> Sales		   62.26 vs  58.63</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Prochnik SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
